This patch will make it possible for you to fall into a pit if you have
crawled out of it or escaped it and you try to sit down on that spot.

You can still escape falling into it if your dexterity is good and you're
lucky. (most of the conditions except for the dexterity one are stolen
from trap.c)

Any comments?

-Josh

--- src/sit.c~	2003-12-25 16:00:11.000000000 -0800
+++ src/sit.c	2003-12-25 16:25:30.000000000 -0800
